what is up everybody welcome back to the  cosmic wonder where we talk all things  marvel and mcu i'm your host warren  thompson and today we have some amazing  news about the marvel cinematic universe  and an upcoming project that i know fans  are going to be super excited for it  seems that an official nova project is  in development right now at marvel  studios looks like richard ryder is  going to be making his way to the mcu  and not too long from now i know this is  great news to many people we have been  talking about richard ryder nova coming  to the mcu for a very long time they set  him up quite perfectly in avengers  infinity war but we'll talk about that  and the support and breakdown everything  you need to know in this video about  nova coming to the mcu and of course if  you're new and you want to stay up to  date on the latest mcu news be sure to  subscribe and hit that bell so you don't  miss out on any of the latest videos now  it did seem like it was only a matter of  time until richard ryder officially made  it to the mcu kevin feige had confirmed  that a nova project was coming a long  time ago and he kind of kept  reconfirming this over the years so we  knew it was coming we just didn't know  when but now things are looking really  really good especially since this  project already has a writer for it they  are actually getting writer sabir  prasada the writer of moon knight to  write nova and trust me when i say this  is fantastic because i've seen the first  few episodes of moon night and they are  great i'm pretty positive moon night is  going to be a lot of people's new  favorite marvel disney plush show not  everybody's new favorite because it is a  very different tone than our traditional  marvel projects but i think a lot of  people are truly going to love moon  knight and it is going to be at least  top 3 best marvel mcu shows now this  report is coming from deadline and if  you don't know deadline they are a very  reputable outlet they've been around for  a very long time they're very big and  very reputable and here's what they say  in their article today exclusive richard  ryder aka nova looks to be joining the  marvel cinematic universe as sources  tell deadline that marvel is developing  a nova project with moon knight scribe  sabir prasada on board to right so there  it is officially nova will be coming now  here's the thing the article goes on to  say that we don't know if it's going to  be a disney plus show or a film now  right away right now let me know in the  comments if you'd like it to be a film  or a disney plus show i personally think  that this could work either way there  are benefits to both doing a disney plus  show and doing a movie i'll use moon  knight for an example you can tell a lot  more story with a disney plush show and  for characters like moon knight who are  very complex and have a lot of story  that you need to tell in order for you  to understand who the character really  is and what they're going through a  disney plush show works great because  you can have six episodes or nine  episodes or however many you need to  truly tell the real story that's going  on that's a big plus to disney plus  however i would say that moon night  looks fantastic and i would have loved  to see a full movie on screen to see it  more cinematically now when i first  watched the first couple of episodes on  moon night i did them on my ipad and  then at the premiere we watched them on  a big screen and i thought wow this is  how everybody should see moon knight but  we're not going to be able to get that  and i only saw the first two episodes  that way and i wish we could see all  episodes that way so there are  advantages to movies as well plus with  movies they have a bigger budget and you  can bring other characters into movies  like the guardians of the galaxy in my  personal opinion should run into nova  and there's actually no reason why nova  can't be introduced before his tv show  or movie and i'll talk about that in a  bit but having a bigger budget is always  great as well so there are advantages  and disadvantages to both of them but  the deadline article goes on to say it  is unknown for now whether this will be  developed as a feature film or a limited  disney plus series as always marvel  studios president feige will produce and  in my opinion that's all you really need  to know right there as long as kevin  feige is the one that is producing this  disney plush show or the film we're in  good hands kevin feige has steered the  mcu in the perfect direction since the  very very beginning so i'm quite sure  the nova project is going to be  fantastic now based off of what we've  already seen in the mcu i think we  probably know a little bit about the  story and possibly the origin that nova  is going to have in the mcu there are  kind of two parts to nova story that i  think we could actually know and again  this is based off of what we've seen so  far and based off what is to come the  first part is avengers infinity war like  i mentioned in the beginning now when  the guardians of the galaxy picked up  thor after thanos decimated his ship  thor told the guardians of the galaxy  that thanos decimated zandar and he got  the power stone and to me this is the  start of nova we were introduced to the  nova corps in guardians of the galaxy  now keep in mind i am going to be  specifically talking about richard  ryder's nova because there is another  nova but we'll focus on richard ryder  now for those of you who don't know i'll  briefly explain kind of the origin in  the comics of richard writer's nova in  the comics when the last surviving  member of the nova corp raman day who we  did meet in guardians of the galaxy when  he is about to die he selects somebody  to give his power to and replace him and  he chooses a high school student in new  york richard ryder giving him all of the  powers of a nova centurion but little  instructions on how to use them now  that's basically what you need to know  so far as far as the origin story is  concerned because let's take that back  to what's happened in the mcu in  infinity war thanos decimated zandar and  the nova corps now during that time  there might be a final survivor who is  about to die it may be ramen day it may  be somebody else but i'm assuming that  before the last person in the nova corp  dies he transfers the nova force power  to richard ryder and this is how the  origin of richard ryder's nova will  begin in the mcu because it just makes  perfect sense it's already been set up  and again kevin foggy has been saying  that nova is coming to the mcu he's been  saying that for a while now so it looks  like the seeds have been planted already  for nova's entrance and it looks like  some of the seeds have actually already  been planted for him to make an mcu  debut maybe before his series or movie  comes out or the events that are about  to take place in the mcu are going to  set up his story and intro very nicely  in his own project deadline goes on to  say in their article nova first appeared  in a 1966 issue of super adventures was  a member of the intergalactic police  force known as the nova corps for which  he gained superhuman abilities including  enhanced strength flight and resistance  to injury while the character didn't  have many run-ins with some of the main  figures of the current or past mcu he  did have some battles with the scrolls  who have big parts in recent and  upcoming marvel projects including  captain marvel and the limited disney  plus series secret invasion i think it  would be perfect if you introduced nova  in the marvels or in secret invasion the  marvels actually makes a lot of sense  captain marvel has been traveling around  the galaxy it would make sense if she  ran into nova at some point in time and  of course as mentioned nova's previous  history with the scroll in the comics  makes for a pretty good entrance and  secret invasion as well if they want to  introduce them before now i also think  that guardians of the galaxy vol 3 would  be pretty perfect as well star-lord and  possibly the rest of the team is going  to want to go to zandar to see what  thanos did to see if anybody is left and  survived this may be where we run into  richard ryder because remember just  because the comics show somebody getting  the novacore richard rider on earth  doesn't mean that that's how it has to  be in the mcu it could be a zendarian so  it is very possible that we could see  him in guardians 3 plus not to mention  the guardians are going to go to at one  point asgard which is now on earth or at  least we assume we think they're going  to drop off thor back at new asgard  again but there is of course always the  chance that he could bail and perhaps  stay on a distant planet then somehow  get back on his own but regardless i  think that nova running into the  guardians of the galaxy would be pretty  cool but let me know what you think  about this super exciting news in the  comments down below how excited are you  to finally see nova in the mcu and how  do you think he should be introduced do  you want a disney plus show or a movie  let me know don't forget to like the  video and subscribe so you don't miss  out on any of the latest mcu news for  live updates you can follow me on  instagram and twitter and as always  thank you all so much for watching woof
 

